lesson: 95
title: How many hours have passed
stars: 0
explain: To find how long something lasts on the same day, count the hours from the start to the end: end minus start.
explain: A game from 2 o'clock to 5 o'clock lasts 5 − 2 = 3 hours.
vars: a=name h=1..9 L=2..8
let: e = h + L
need: e <= 12
answer: L
exercise: The picnic starts at {h} o'clock and ends at {e} o'clock. How many hours does it last?
exercise: {a} leaves home at {h} o'clock and comes back at {e} o'clock. How many hours is {a.he} away?
exercise: A film begins at {h} o'clock and is over at {e} o'clock. How many hours long is the film?
exercise: The shop opens at {h} o'clock and closes at {e} o'clock on the same day. How many hours is it open?
exercise: {a} works in the garden from {h} o'clock to {e} o'clock. How many hours does {a.he} work?
test: By {e} o'clock {a} has been at the fair since {h} o'clock. How many hours has {a.he} spent there?
test: How many hours pass between {h} o'clock and {e} o'clock?
test: {a} goes to sleep for a nap at {h} o'clock. {a.He} wakes up at {e} o'clock on the same day. For how many hours did {a.he} sleep?
test: The bus trip ends at {e} o'clock. It started at {h} o'clock. How long was the trip, in hours?
exercise: How many hours does a picnic last if it starts at {h} o'clock and ends at {e} o'clock?
exercise: {a} plays outside from {h} o'clock until {e} o'clock. How many hours does {a.he} play?
exercise: Start {h} o'clock, end {e} o'clock. How many hours is that?
exercise: The library in Boston opens at {h} o'clock and shuts at {e} o'clock. For how many hours is it open?
exercise: {a} is at a football match from {h} o'clock to {e} o'clock. How many hours long is {a.his} visit?
exercise: A school trip in Manchester starts at {h} o'clock and finishes at {e} o'clock. How many hours does it take?
exercise: {a} helps on a farm from {h.words} o'clock to {e.words} o'clock. How many hours does {a.he} help?
exercise: The fun run begins at {h} o'clock and the last runner comes in at {e} o'clock. How many hours is the run?
test: {a} arrives at the beach in Sydney at {h} o'clock and leaves at {e} o'clock. How long, in hours, does {a.he} stay?
test: It is {e} o'clock now. The rain began at {h} o'clock and has not stopped. How many hours has it been raining?
test: From {h} o'clock to {e} o'clock on the same day, how many hours go by?
test: {a} switches on the oven at {h} o'clock and turns it off at {e} o'clock. How many hours was the oven on?
test: The ferry from Wellington leaves at {h} o'clock and arrives at {e} o'clock. How many hours is the crossing?
test: {a}'s party is over at {e} o'clock; it started at {h} o'clock. For how many hours did it go on?
exercise: picnic {h} til {e} o'clock, how many hours that
exercise: {a} left home at {h+1}, no wait, {h} o'clock, back at {e}. how many hours gone
exercise: {a} says the film was {h+e} hours cos {h} plus {e}. nah, {h} to {e} o'clock, how long really
exercise: footy {h} o'clock to {e} o'clock, we had like 3 oranges at half time, how many hours
test: started {h}, done by {e}. hrs?
test: party goes from {h+1}, no, {h} o'clock till {e}, how many hours long
test: my nan thinks {h} to {e} is {L+1} hours, she counts both. how many hours really
exam: It is given that an event commences at {h} o'clock and concludes at {e} o'clock on the same day. Determine its duration in hours.
exam: Ascertain the number of hours which elapse between the departure of {a} at {h} o'clock and {a.his} return at {e} o'clock.
exam: Whereas a meeting is convened at {h.words} o'clock and adjourned at {e.words} o'clock, state the length of the meeting in hours.
exam: Compute the interval, expressed in hours, from {h} o'clock until {e} o'clock of the same morning or afternoon.
exercise: Grandma's celebration of life starts at {h} o'clock and ends at {e} o'clock. How many hours does it last?
exercise: Uncle Bob says he is going "to see a man about a dog" at {h} o'clock and comes back at {e} o'clock. How many hours is he gone?
test: {a} went to spend a penny at {h} o'clock and strolled back at {e}. how many hours was that, the lazy git
